title: "Trustworthy Stock Intelligence"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Chien-Hsun Chang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
url: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.11.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
abstract: >-
  Research software for stock drawdown-risk analysis with temporal validation,
  calibration, uncertainty, trust scores and warning explanations. Version
  0.11.0 requires Python 3.11 or newer and updates image, notebook and installer
  security dependencies. The served model is unchanged. It is not externally
  validated research or investment advice.
keywords:
  - stock risk
  - trustworthy AI
  - calibration
  - uncertainty estimation
  - temporal validation
  - financial machine learning
